  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0 - Fleshed-out Window wrapper (timers, requestAnimationFrame/requestIdleCallback, fetch, file-system pickers, scroll/resize/move/open/postMessage), SpawnJSRuntime.Fetch, Toolbox.Async helper, parameterless AddSpawnJSRuntime(). Fixes: reading a JS number into Nullable<T> over the frame path; Array<T> deserialization ctor (took IJSInProcessObjectReference, which Activator.CreateInstance could not bind, causing MissingConstructor_Name when marshalling a JS array into Array<T>).",
